  "_comment": "Template for .claude/settings.local.json — machine-only overrides. Copy to .claude/settings.local.json (git-ignored) and edit. Do NOT set permissions.defaultMode to bypassPermissions: it disables every deny rule in .claude/settings.json for this machine, including the secret-file and destructive-command guards.",
